;; Two lattice reads in one rule, in-SCC: the delta-driven read drives and
;; the second becomes a payload-map probe against the master mid-fixpoint
;; (the join-lat operator inside the recursion).  (+ D1 D2) is monotone in
;; both arguments, so contributing the sum is admitted.

lattice (cost (min int #:floor 0))
table (edge int int int)
table (dist int int cost)

rule (edge 1 2 1) (edge 2 3 1) (edge 3 4 1)

rule (edge X Y W) --> (dist X Y W)
rule (dist X Y D1) (dist Y Z D2) --> (dist X Z (+ D1 D2))
